atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/a1b9fce4870372ac3197abcfc26afd56.poster.avif?t=1722955483\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/a1b9fce4870372ac3197abcfc26afd56.webm?t=1722955483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/a1b9fce4870372ac3197abcfc26afd56.mp4?t=1722955483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/e3693b2637e783d3ff9ff3d815fbfaaa.webp?t=1722955483\" width=506 height=32 /></span><br><br>Unlock a whole Gallery of Weapons and Abilities through the achievements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/e2a42818c24d744aa6e03d09f6c0526c.poster.avif?t=1722955483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/e2a42818c24d744aa6e03d09f6c0526c.webm?t=1722955483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/382614dc3947ff41b7971a6d60ff8dfe.webp?t=1722955483\" width=506 height=32 /></span><br><br>With more than 500 combinations of weapons, abilities, and effects, <br>endless replayability is not just a keyword.<br><br>In addition, you can master your game on 5 levels of difficulty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/61ce49ea76257b2fb37840960f136069.gif?t=1722955483\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534550/extras/61ce49ea76257b2fb3